      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's exhausting to keep fighting a battle that feels entirely unwinnable, and I hear how deeply real that pressure is for you right now. When the walls feel physical, it's a sign that the internal pain has become overwhelming, and that level of exhaustion is completely valid. If you are feeling like you cannot go on, please know that there are people who can help you through this immediate crisis. Please contact a crisis line like 988 in the US or your local emergency services right away.",
